  "details": "I would like IP addresses that have already gone through two-factor authentication to not require it again after a re-login. Additionally, if I have already disabled two-factor authentication, I shouldn’t be forced to go through it again, as this is unnecessary and makes the process more inconvenient for players. It would also be helpful if, in account settings, I could toggle two-factor email verification after logging in, even if I haven’t specifically set it up yet.",
